├── shared/                           # types/schemas genuinely shared between frontend and backend (generated from Pydantic/OpenAPI where possible)
├── infra/
│   ├── terraform/
│   └── docker/
├── scripts/                          # seed data, local setup, migration helpers — never security bypasses
└── IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md          # living log of completed milestones — see §9.2
```

**Rule:** a Bounded Context's internal modules are never imported directly from another context. Cross-context interaction goes through that context's declared service interface only. This is what keeps a future service extraction (noted as a Future Evolution path) a matter of moving a package, not untangling imports.

